 growing demand for skilled labor from the industries as Cambodia is transitioning to Digital Economy and Industry 4.0. It is worth highlighting that CamTech\u2019s goals and vision align well with those of MOWA since we both are striving to promote STEAM education, entrepreneurship, and woman empowerment. CamTech University is dedicated to building more partnerships with relevant Ministry, Industry and Community to provide high-quality education and equip our students with pertinent skills and knowledge. Related Events<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":13823,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"elementor_header_footer","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[179],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-13806","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13806","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=13806"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13806\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":14360,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13806\/revisions\/14360"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/13823"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=13806"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=13806"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.e